  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap fell 5.2% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $277.43B (5.2% lower over 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-11-13-thailand-seeks-daily-stablecoin-cap-439676\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Thailand seeks $148,000 daily cap on certain stablecoin transfers to curb money laundering</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/383096/sofi-brings-bank-issued-stablecoin-polygon-payments-stack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SoFi Brings Its Bank-Issued Stablecoin to Polygon\u2019s Payments Stack</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/11/15/xrp-crashes-to-its-lowest-since-november-2024-as-money-leaves-crypto\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">XRP crashes to its lowest since November 2024 as money leaves crypto</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
